# UI

- Follow `UI_GUIDELINES.md`.
- Never redesign screens without approval.
- Optimize for speed and minimum taps.
- Do not invent UI patterns for open questions in `UI_GUIDELINES.md`; ask or document the decision first.
- Reuse shared components; keep screens visually consistent.
- Prefer one-tap actions and avoid unnecessary navigation.
